WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.187
The 1980s.

00:00:02.137 --> 00:00:04.825
Constitution and Free Trade.

00:00:04.825 --> 00:00:08.512
The National Energy Program devastates Alberta.

00:00:08.512 --> 00:00:14.300
The Charter of Rights and Freedoms is patriated in 1982 without Quebec's consent.

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:19.625
Mulroney signs the Free Trade Agreement with the US and the failed Meech Lake Accord.
